 ('chiefs_by_places_listed', 'status', "the chiefs by their places listed — the STATUS the closing ledger writes on the chiefs of Esau: 'and these are the names of the chiefs of Esau, by their families, by their places, by their names' (36:40) — eleven chiefs to 'he is Esau, father of Edom' (36:43)",
  H(36, 40, 'ואלה שמות אלופי עשו למשפחתם למקמתם בשמתם', 'and these are the names of the chiefs of Esau, by their families, by their places, by their names'), "Gen 36:40-43 (chief Timna, chief Oholibamah among them — a woman's name as a chiefdom); %s 83:4-5" % BR, C((36, 40), (36, 41), (36, 42), (36, 43)), X + ' (edom)'),
